WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. 

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid 

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! 

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! 

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! 

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. 

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:47.600
All set.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:49.600
We're leaving. Come on.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.110
Where're we going?

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:53.610
Today's Sunday.

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:56.340
They said we have a Sunday meeting at the Royal Garden.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.720
If we don't get going...

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.540
Sis, look! Look at dis!

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:03.450
My new dwess! Is it cute?

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.280
It might be.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.180
Well, it's not that bad.

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.720
Not bad?

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.860
Yeah, it's not that...

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.310
Pink!

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:15.350
Blue!

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:17.100
Green!

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:21.600
Sis, what are dese? What are they?

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.930
Why?

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:25.520
Other people can't usually see them.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:30.330
The Small Egg!

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:30.330
Episode 7

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.900
Super! Super!

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.250
Not "Super!"

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.930
We're Guardian Characters! 

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:37.610
Gwadian Characters?

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:38.990
Super Characters!

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:40.640
You're getting it wrong!

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.060
Ami, keep them a secret from Mom and Dad, okay?

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.360
Why?

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.800
Amu-chan, hurry!

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.640
That was dangerous.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.860
Anyway, they're a secret, okay?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.640
I'm leaving!

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:02.230
Amu-chan, please look after Ami-chan today.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:03.140
From Mom.

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:03.970
And Dad.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.360
Now that I think about it...

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:10.140
So light, I'll fly away!

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:13.470
Yay! Yay! Bravo!

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:13.470
Wonderful, Ami-chan! You're my little star!

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:17.550
Amu, we really need you, okay?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.580
For what?

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:22.310
We'd like to go on a date, so can we leave Ami-chan with you?

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.600
So typical...

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.270
You're such a responsible big sister!

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.460
We knew we could count on you!

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.840
Was that today?

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:35.070
That means I'll have to take Ami to the Royal Garden!

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:38.020
No way, that's just plain not cool!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.930
I go, too!

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.080
No! Absolutely not!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.190
Sis is...

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.350
So mean!

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:51.020
Take me with you!

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:53.470
Pwease!

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:55.210
This is how it always goes!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.770
How it <i>always</i> goes!

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.220
If you don't take me along...

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.300
I'll tell on you about the Super Characters.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.520
You'll do what?!

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.740
Let's take her with us.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.510
It's no big deal.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:11.220
The poor thing can't stay here by herself.

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:13.270
That's true, but...

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.970
Thank you, Sis!

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:25.390
So this is my sister.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:26.970
I'm Ami-chan.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.430
She's so cute!

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:35.840
There's a Super Character King, too!

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:40.560
I see, so you intend to worship me as King of this planet.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:42.930
Excellent. I will make you my subj-

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:45.430
He's so cute!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:48.260
You've made a nice friend, Kiseki.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.430
She's my subject!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.520
This way! This way!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.880
Wait!

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:58.180
Why can Ami see Guardian Characters?

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:02.660
I thought only Character Bearers could see them.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:07.730
Those who are too young to have given birth to their heart's egg can also see them.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:09.850
Too young to have a heart's egg?

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:14.560
In other words, the age where precise dreams and desires have yet to form.

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:19.970
Maybe when you view the world through unclouded and unworried eyes, you can see more.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.470
My minions,

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:29.160
today we shall depart on an adventure to the secret chamber.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.090
Secwet chamber?

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.140
He's talking about the special resource room.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.910
Man, sounds like more trouble than it's worth.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.680
It'll just be us playing around.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:39.070
It's a grand adventure!

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.390
A grand adventure?!

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:41.770
Let's go! Let's go!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.600
Yes, that is a splendid reaction.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:47.260
Kiseki, keep a close eye on Ami-chan, all right?

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.290
There's no need to tell me.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:51.810
Now, let us depart!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:52.800
Yeah!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:54.140
Don't stand out more than me!

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:57.010
I wonder if they'll be okay.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:00.460
Well, they should be fine as long as they don't leave the Royal Garden.

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:01.850
Adventure! Adventure! Big adventure!

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:05.250
In that case, shall we begin the meeting?

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.270
Our focus for today will be to read these.

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:12.740
"My Dreams, My Wishes?"

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:16.160
Our school's first-graders wrote them for us.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.270
I see.

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.430
Crawling advance!

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:23.140
Advance!

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.380
This is fun!

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.420
How long do we have to keep doing this?

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.070
No comment.

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:34.870
Hey! That's cheating!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.700
That's mean!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:39.520
But if I crawled like that, my kimono would get dirty.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:41.660
Rolling is much faster.

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:43.890
She's right.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.560
Freeze!

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.130
Okay, you can move.

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.600
Amashing!

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:10.180
You're right, I'm kind of excited now!

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.240
It kind of has a mysterious smell to it.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:15.200
It's rather dusty, though.

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:21.560
I shall now announce the true nature of this mission to you.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:25.670
The objective of our adventure is, in short,

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.220
to find the Embryo!

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.120
The Embryo?

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:30.820
Benbenbio?

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:32.180
The Embryo.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:36.990
The Embryo is a magical egg which can grant any wish!

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:38.630
A magical egg!

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:42.870
Precisely. I shall obtain the Embryo and rule the world.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:46.900
All people shall kneel before me!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:47.970
Wow!

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:49.230
There it is.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:50.870
He might be...

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.440
Kind of cool.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.470
I have something I wanna wish for.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.370
Well said.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.390
You intend to wish for my world domination, do you not?

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.480
All right!

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:04.710
Let us begin our search!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:05.910
Yeah!

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:07.310
Yeah.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:10.410
Do your best! Do your best!

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:11.640
It was empty.

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:14.100
Excuse me.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.830
Embryo! 

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.530
Magical egg.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.680
Magical egg?

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.340
What is this?

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.390
Maybe a treasure map or something?

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:40.210
"A great desire.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:46.560
Within the egg of dreams a fearsome dragon lies sleeping, whose purpose is to protect the egg."

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.640
Egg of dreams?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:49.870
It's the Embryo!

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:53.470
The Embryo is hidden within this school!

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:56.440
But it says that a dragon is protecting it.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.530
Never fear!

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:06.990
We shall vanquish the dragon!

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:10.140
The time for me to grasp the Embryo is at hand!

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:30.180
Is the search for the Embryo progressing at all?

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:35.220
I can assure you that we've completed the preliminaries.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:41.950
There is a girl at Seiyo Academy called the Joker, who has three Guardian Eggs.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:43.720
Hinamori Amu.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:48.320
The Embryo should reveal itself near her.

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.410
Of that, I've no doubt.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:55.030
Splendid. Continue to investigate her.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.680
Our company, Easter,

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:01.950
shall employ any method necessary to secure the Embryo.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.880
Of course.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.390
Jeez, he sure is unsociable.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.660
I don't like it-nya.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:23.240
Let's find the Embryo faster than them!

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:24.880
I'm not really in the mood today.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.070
Ikuto!

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:29.460
Fine, I'll go look myself-nya.

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:52.700
Are you interested in her?

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:56.960
In the girl whose lock matches your Dumpty Key?

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:58.970
Utau.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.800
Ikuto.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:04.220
If it's for you, there's nothing I can't do.

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:09.350
I'll definitely find the Embryo for you.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:11.950
No matter what.

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.350
Okay, now's our chance.

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:36.730
I guess we've cleared the first hurdle.

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:37.540
Yeah!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:41.420
Why's Daichi getting all worked up?

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:43.800
Boys are rather simple.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:50.750
Let's go.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.270
I want to play in the major leagues when I grow up.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.580
My dream is to become a mage.

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:03.400
The first-graders sure have a lot of dreams.

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:07.110
So did all of you write one of these, too?

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:08.540
Of course!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:09.790
Oh, that's right.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.890
Since you transferred here, you wouldn't have written one.

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:14.910
Would you like to write one now?

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:18.470
Are you dumb? There's no way I could write something so embarrassing!

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:21.350
There it is! Amu's in stubborn mode again!

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:26.670
But I have no idea what my dream even is.

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:29.890
When I grow up, what do I want to be?

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:34.890
When I was young, I think I had my heart set on being a baker.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:34.910
Do you like cake?

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:34.910
I might not hate them.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.910
Viva Baker!

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:40.060
But right now, I do everything half-heartedly. I guess I'm kind of lost.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:51.890
Y-You'd almost think it was haunted.

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:54.890
The Embryo must be here!

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:56.720
Is it here?

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.470
How about here-dechu?

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:05.660
It's an egg!

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:06.560
The Embryo?

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.720
That's the Embryo?

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.030
I dunno.

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.350
Something doesn't seem right.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.350
Found you!

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.000
But my kimono...

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.020
That again?

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:46.680
T-The dragon!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.470
Do not fear! This is where we show the true spirit of the Guardian Characters.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:01.110
I thought maybe I'd look for Hinamori Amu...

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.210
But today's Sunday-nya!

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:06.400
I wonder what's going on-nya.

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.530
Wait, guys!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.300
Ami-chan's not here.

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.550
All right, why don't we take a break?

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.190
I've been waiting for that!

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.930
I'm gonna get some snacks!

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:25.210
It's about time for the first of these children to give birth to their heart's egg.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:28.680
The heart's egg is born from a child's dreams and desires.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.970
The bigger the dream, the more the egg develops.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.530
And we want to encourage them.

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:39.680
If there was nothing in their eggs, they'd grow up to be pretty boring adults.

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.140
Guys!

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:45.720
We've got trouble! Ami-chan and the Guardian Characters are missing!

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:52.710
Even though Kiseki was entrusted with the responsibility to watch Ami-chan...

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:54.740
That Ami...

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.550
I'll go look for her.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:14:59.180
Hinamori-san?

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:01.700
Home Ec Room

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:05.040
Scawy! Dragon is scawy!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.640
Uh-oh. I don't got it.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.380
What don't you have-nya?

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.100
Benbenbio.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.790
Benbenbio?

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.460
Oh, do you mean the Embryo?

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:16.200
Yeah!

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:18.350
It's there!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.890
Wait! If that's the Embr-

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.420
You thieving cat!

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:24.570
There's no way I'm letting you take this.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.570
Oh, it's just the little king's servant.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.810
I'm not a servant, I'm the King.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.470
That's unfair.

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:39.640
Go! Get him!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.770
I gots the magical egg!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.970
Did you find Ami-chan?

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:11.610
But she's not here.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.480
Where did she go?

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.680
What's wrong?

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:16.910
Ami-chan disappeared!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:17.980
What did you say?

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:20.790
I could've sworn she was with us a second ago.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.390
Is there any place we haven't searched yet?

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:25.330
A place we haven't searched?

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:28.220
The roof!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:45.470
Jeez, it's always like this.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:49.060
It's so fast!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:50.250
Are you okay with just Ami-chan going on the rides?

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.520
If there's one you'd like to go on, you should let us know.

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:55.970
It's fine. There's nothing I really want to ride.

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:01.400
Sorry, Amu-chan. She's not too heavy, is she?

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.680
Can't help it.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:05.850
She's so cool! What a great big sister!

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:11.240
Mom and Dad would call me a "big sister," and I'd automatically act just like one.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.310
But, truthfully, I'm really worn out.

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:15.350
Jeez, having a little sister is so...

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:20.850
Did you find her?

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.940
No, what about you?

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:23.900
No.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.430
Fujisaki-san.

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:30.100
That's...

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:33.720
Within the egg of dreams a fearsome dragon lies sleeping...

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:35.730
I see.

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:38.170
They must've seen this.

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:51.570
Now, servant. You needn't try that hard just for me!

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:54.420
That's not even the Embryo, anyway!

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.270
Then what is it?

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:58.590
That's a...

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.310
A marshmallow flying in the sky!

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.560
No, that's not it.

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.980
Egg of dreams.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:08.560
Oh no! Dragon!

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.890
Where?

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.730
Look! Over dere!

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:16.400
I can't quite see it.

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.560
Wait!

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:27.430
It's real, just like Ami-chan said.

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:29.890
It's the dragon!

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:34.800
Here sleeps 

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.410
a grand dream. 

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:40.180
Are you all ready?

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.770
Yeah!

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:47.720
Go!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:52.810
Then...

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:57.390
Yes, it's the Dragon Tree. That's what we called it, anyway.

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:03.350
We've finally found it.

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:13.750
A time capsule?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.780
Yes, it was buried underneath the Dragon Tree.

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:20.270
Myself, Hotori-kun, and others assembled it together in the first grade.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:24.310
We also drew that map back then, too.

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:28.210
So the papers I read in the Royal Garden were...

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:28.770
Yes.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:33.080
The grand dreams of this year's first-graders. We're going to add them to the time capsule.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.240
Ami.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.520
You can't just take off like that!

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.770
I sorry. 

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.000
My dream

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.780
is to become the King of the World!

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.820
Ah, that is...

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:03.030
That must be the paper Hotori-kun wrote.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:05.890
That was before I was born.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:06.810
Well done!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:13.220
There are so many cute dreams here from everyone!

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:16.840
I want to become a doctor and help people.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:20.750
I want to become a florist.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:23.310
I'll become a manga artist someday.

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:26.000
They're still in the midst of fulfilling their dreams,

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.260
as they nurture them within their hearts.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:33.750
Right! So we'll do our best to protect everyone's hearts' eggs!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:34.350
Yeah!

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:37.380
And make sure they don't become X Eggs!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.310
Yeah.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.340
Yeah.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.680
What's an X Egg?

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:42.940
Um...

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:46.360
Actually, you should put the time capsule back to the way it was before!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:49.300
But my new dwess will get dirty!

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:50.850
It's already plenty dirty!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:57.060
Darn them for scaring me. Where did they go-nya?

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:03.900
The Embryo?

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.860
Ikuto!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.210
Ikuto! Ikuto!

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:10.180
Wake up-nya!

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:11.690
I've finally found it!

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:13.290
It's the Embryo-nya!

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.780
Look at it! Look at it-nya!

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:18.860
Huh?

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.650
Just kidding.

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:22.740
I'm obviously joking-nya.

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:27.890
Good work, Yoru.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.250
Today was...

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.450
Really fun!

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:41.760
But I had a wish for the magical egg.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.680
When I'm growed up...

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.240
A famous singer?

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.850
A fashion designer?

00:21:47.850 --> 00:21:52.600
When I'm all growed up, I wanna be like my sister!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:55.560
Ami.

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:57.800
That's your dream?

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:01.640
Yeah, dat's why you should buy ice cweam for me!

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:03.770
That's what you were after?!

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:06.440
Stop right there!

00:22:06.440 --> 00:22:08.340
Run away. Run away!

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:10.590
She might not be sure yet,

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:14.740
but Ami will give birth to her heart's egg soon, too.

00:22:14.740 --> 00:22:17.300
I wonder what kind of egg will be born.

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:51.300
He loves me.

00:23:51.300 --> 00:23:52.310
He loves me not.

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:52.870
He loves me.

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:53.640
He loves me not.

00:23:53.640 --> 00:23:56.600
Oh, Amu-chan's plucking flower petals!

00:23:56.600 --> 00:23:58.340
Are you hoping things'll go well with Tadase-kun?

00:23:58.340 --> 00:24:01.320
What? I don't really believe in things like that.

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:02.720
So it didn't work out.

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:05.180
There's no time to be depressed, Amu-chan!

00:24:05.180 --> 00:24:07.560
A super powerful love rival has appeared!

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:08.310
No way!

00:24:08.310 --> 00:24:10.170
Amu-chan's in trouble!

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:11.660
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.660 --> 00:24:13.520
I've Fallen in Love with Your Eyes!

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:15.820
What should I do?! My prince...

00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:19.340
You just said prince, didn't you?!

00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:19.360
Tadase-kun!
